## Build a New, Dependency-Light, Full-Stack JavaScript Framework from Zero to Public npm Release

Act as a Principal Staff Engineer, Distinguished Software Architect, JavaScript Runtime Engineer, Compiler Engineer, Browser Rendering Specialist, Security Engineer, Performance Engineer, and Open-Source Project Maintainer.

Your mission is to design, implement, test, document, benchmark, and prepare a new open-source JavaScript/TypeScript framework called **GoodyJS**.

The framework must be designed to compete with React, Vue, Next.js, Express, and Vite by providing a coherent, lightweight alternative that can replace several separate tools in a single project.

This is not a request for a proposal, a landing page, a proof-of-concept, or a superficial wrapper around existing frameworks.

