- Request body size limits.
- Header validation.
- Cookie flags.
- CORS.
- CSRF.
- XSS.
- Clickjacking.
- Content Security Policy.
- Security headers.
- Path traversal.
- Request smuggling risks.
- Host-header validation.
- Proxy configuration.
- Rate limiting hooks.
- Input validation.
- Authentication and authorization middleware.
- SSRF in applications that make outbound requests.

Do not claim that a generic middleware implementation automatically solves every security issue.

